/Title (The work begins by working the Upper Back flat while shaping the shoulders. Stitches are picked up from each shoulder for the Left and Right Fronts separately and worked flat. All stitches are then joined together to work the lower body flat. Stitches are picked up from the armhole openings for the sleeves, which are then worked in the round. Lastly, stitches are picked up from the entire neckline and front edges for a double-knit button band.)
